{"4916030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TYBALT", "steam_appid": 4916030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/3c1c4217d32a0d5e5201c55bce3f58ef.poster.avif?t=1788082914\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/3c1c4217d32a0d5e5201c55bce3f58ef.webm?t=1788082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/3c1c4217d32a0d5e5201c55bce3f58ef.mp4?t=1788082914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[video_and_screenshot_files_temporarily_distor███]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/2dc53812b59fbc9816cc170689506e45.avif?t=1788082914\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras_big/2dc53812b59fbc9816cc170689506e45.webp?t=1788082914 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNVEIL HUMANITY'S FATE. SAVE HUMANITY. NOT DESTROY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has fallen silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to reproduce and facing inevitable biological extinction, the last humans entered cryogenic sleep, entrusting their fate to artificial intelligences tasked with finding a solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years have passed. Hundreds. Thousands. Hundreds of thousands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No solution has been found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And humanity still sleeps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SANDBOX. STORY MISSIONS. FINAL DESTINATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Sandbox mode missions, explore and clear encounters, hack terminals, defeat enemies, avoid viruses, and gather lore-related information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To immerse yourself further, test your skills in story missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, gear up for the final challenge that will challenge everything you’ve learned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TYBALT. TYPHON. TYRANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three artificial intelligences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three interpretations of salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Keepers of humanity and the worlds shaped by an endless purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PTOLEMIA. CAPANEUS. PHLEGETHON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the frozen necropolis of PTOLEMIA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the terraforming halls of CAPANEUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk upon the factories of PHLEGETHON.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECTER. PHANTOM. WRAITH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three vessels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ways to obey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECTER </strong>[<span class=\"bb_strike\">CREATION OF TYBALT</span>] - Become unseen. Infiltrate restricted spaces, avoid confrontation, and steal what was never meant to be shared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHANTOM</strong> [<span class=\"bb_strike\">CREATION OF TYPHON</span>] - Become motion. Traverse hostile worlds with extreme mobility, speed, and aggression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH</strong> [<span class=\"bb_strike\">CREATION OF TYRANT</span>] -  Become destruction. Wield overwhelming firepower and endure what the others cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/b09e189db6ca732e87e9f26d7886b546.poster.avif?t=1788082914\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/b09e189db6ca732e87e9f26d7886b546.webm?t=1788082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/b09e189db6ca732e87e9f26d7886b546.mp4?t=1788082914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three distinct playstyles</strong> - Shift between stealth, high-mobility action, and heavily armed combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the remnants of humanity</strong> - Journey through colossal artificial worlds, abandoned facilities, cryogenic necropolises, and terraformed planets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Keepers</strong> - Discover three ancient artificial intelligences whose interpretation of the same command has diverged over hundreds of thousands of years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal forbidden knowledge</strong> - Infiltrate domains never intended for human eyes and reconstruct the truth from fragmented archives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover humanity's fate</strong> - Piece together what happened after humanity surrendered its future to machines.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMANITY WAITS. THE KEEPERS ENDURE. YOU AWAKEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/869ed73c46f8a02ce2f2fee2502b04d9.poster.avif?t=1788082914\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/869ed73c46f8a02ce2f2fee2502b04d9.webm?