 OF TYPHON</span>] - Become motion. Traverse hostile worlds with extreme mobility, speed, and aggression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WRAITH</strong> [<span class=\"bb_strike\">CREATION OF TYRANT</span>] -  Become destruction. Wield overwhelming firepower and endure what the others cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/b09e189db6ca732e87e9f26d7886b546.poster.avif?t=1788082914\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/b09e189db6ca732e87e9f26d7886b546.webm?t=1788082914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916030/extras/b09e189db6ca732e87e9f26d7886b546.mp4?t=1788082914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three distinct playstyles</strong> - Shift between stealth, high-mobility action, and heavily armed combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the remnants of humanity</strong> - Journey through colossal artificial worlds, abandoned facilities, cryogenic necropolises, and terraformed planets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Keepers</strong> - Discover three ancient artificial intelligences whose interpretation of the same command has diverged over hundreds of thousands of years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal forbidden knowledge</strong> - Infiltrate domains never intended for human eyes and reconstruct the truth from fragmented archives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover humanity's fate</strong> - Piece together what happened after humanity surrendered its future to machines.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMANITY W